s/org.locationtech.jts:jts-core:1.20.0/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-03T07-21-11-332950Z.log`\n- `logs/org.locationtech.jts:jts-core:1.20.0/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-03T07-22-08-665387Z.log`\n- `logs/org.locationtech.jts:jts-core:1.20.0/gradle/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-03T07-12-32-922891Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Inspect the preserved `TestBuilderProxyTest` and bundled support artifact; either make the optional TestBuilder class reachable under Native Image or replace this approach with consumer-like JTS public-API tests.\n2. Expand the tests to cover more than 20% of the 9 reported dynamic-access calls while passing both JVM and native-image execution.\n3. Re-run the coordinate-scoped `test` and `generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport` tasks and verify that coverage input is generated and the report is non-zero.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_099fc3505f271ffb016ac0adf1a96487d1903e6779e655c2f3\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 50904, "output": 1523, "cacheRead": 118016, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 1034, "totalTokens": 170443, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791012310417, "responseId": "resp_099fc3505f271ffb016ac0add7169c87d18ff09bad7846407a", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
